      "exhibit": "C-9",
      "page": 4,
      "text": "The meeting was kicked off by a speech delivered by Hongru Mei, Chairman of China Shippers' Association, on behalf of Qixuan An, Chairman of China Digital Commerce Association and former Vice Minister of Ministry of Foreign Trade and Economic Cooperation. Chairman Zhang pointed out that the deep integration of the new generation of information technology with the production, manufacturing and distribution systems is leading to far- reaching industrial changes and forming new modes of production, industrial forms, business models and new economic growth points. The country is stepping up efforts in scientific and technological innovation to promote innovation and breakthroughs in big data, mobile Internet, Internet of Things, new energy and new materials, etc. All these will form a great impetus of our economic and cultural construction. Chenyu Bai, Executive Vice Chairman and Secretary General of China Digital Commerce Association, presided over the working meeting. He believes that an important responsibility of smart retail is to participate in the marketing of products from market demand to production, processing and innovation, and finally to consumers, which is the service of the whole industrial chain. This brings another important responsibility, which means, smart retail must shoulder the responsibility of shaping the enterprise and its",
